OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 29 MAR
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy serves up his last sonic
OL,6,     Gcocktail of 2026 including loads
OL,7,     Gof show favourites. Expect key
OL,8,     Gcuts by the likes of Sleaford
OL,9,     GMods, Mediaeval Baebes, Albert
OL,10,     GAyler, Miles and more.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GMary Anne wishes Iggy happy
OL,13,     Gtrails, as he takes a gap-year at
OL,14,     G6 Music. Plus some music from
OL,15,     Gthis weekend's 6 Music Festival.
OL,16,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,17,     GAs the 6 Music Festival returns
OL,18,     Gto Manchester, Stuart looks at
OL,19,     Gthe more experimental side of its
OL,20,     Gmusic scene.
